7. PW-1 Awadesh in paras (i) to (vi) of affidavit Ex.PW-1/A has inter alia deposed about - (i) fracture of left leg and blunt injury on head/scalp, knee and all over his body sustained in road accident near the corner of Green View Apartment, Dwarka, Delhi on 31.05.2017 at around 9:00 am after his bicycle was hit by offending WagonR car driven in rash and negligent manner;
(ii) treatment at Venkateshwara Hospital, Delhi and RML Hospital, Delhi where he remained admitted till 15.06.2017; (iii) expenses incurred on medicine, treatment, conveyance, special diet,
attendant etc.; (iv) monthly income Rs.12,500/- by doing private job in the Canteen of Venkateshwara Hospital, Delhi AND (v) general and special damages on account of bodily injury sustained in road accident.

PW-1 has also relied upon following documents referred in his affidavit:
i. Medical Bills - Ex.PW-1/1;
ii. Discharge Summary of RML Hospital - Ex.PW-1/2;
iii. Copy of Aadhar Card - Ex.PW-1/3;
iv. DAR - ExPW-1/4.
MACT No. 874/2017 Awadesh Vs. Yogender Kumar & Ors.
